\frametitle{Section With Pictures}
As the following command indicates, it is possible to include pictures under a section title:
		\begin{verbatim}			
			\providecommand{\sectionImage}{
				\begin{center}
					\includegraphics[width=5cm,draft]{\PathSO/UGE/logos/UGE-logo.pdf}
				\end{center}
			}
			\addtobeamertemplate{section frame}{}{
				\addtobeamertemplate{section page}{}{\sectionImage}
			}
			\section{Things good to know about Beamer}
			\renewcommand{\sectionImage}{}	
		\end{verbatim}
